SUMMARY:Understanding & Countering Misinformation\, Disinformation\, &
  Malinformation - by Egale Canada
LOCATION:Virtual
DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://egale-ca.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_GvJgr7iOTeOOdhji3C3AOg#/regi
 stration\n\nHosted by Egale Canada (https://egale.ca/)\n\nMisinformation\,
  disinformation\, and malinformation (MDM) are increasingly shaping online
  spaces and public discourse. This webinar offers a practical introduction
  to MDM—what it is\, how it spreads\, why it matters\, and how it
  impacts 2SLGBTQI communities in particular. The session will also provide
  practical tools to help you respond effectively.
END:VEVENT
