SUMMARY:Pleasure and overdose response: how people wake up matters - by
  Drug Lab
LOCATION:Virtual
DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://us06web.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_2ihrZ3fBSjKSBx7czvAMjg#/regis
 tration\n\nHosted by Drug Lab (https://www.druglab.ca/)\n\nIn this
  webinar\, Dr. Geoff Bardwell will share findings from interviews with
  people who use opioids in Kitchener and Galt\, Ontario\, who spoke about
  getting high\, overdosing\, and “coming to” afterward. Geoff and
  community partners will discuss how context shapes people’s experiences
  of getting high\, overdosing\, and being revived.
END:VEVENT
